<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: WATERFORD FOODS board accepts bid - report.</title>
<headline>WATERFORD FOODS board accepts bid - report.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of Wateford Foods Foods has accepted an improved merger bid rom Avonmore Foods Plce AVFA.L), Irish state radio reported on Tuesday.</p>
<p>It said the board met on Monday night to consider the improved offer, which would now be put to be a full shareholders and Co-Operative members.</p>
</text>
